msgstr "让点击穿透到桌面"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:250
msgctxt "settings section"
msgid "Silence"
msgstr "静音"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:254
msgid "In silence:"
msgstr "静音时："

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:255
msgid "dissolve the ring"
msgstr "让圆环消散"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:260
msgid "Silence threshold, %:"
msgstr "静音阈值 (%)："

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:268
msgid "Wait before vanishing, ms:"
msgstr "消失前等待 (毫秒)："

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:277
msgid "Fade in and out, ms:"
msgstr "淡入淡出 (毫秒)："

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:286
msgid "Polls per second in silence:"
msgstr "静音时每秒轮询次数："

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:293
msgid ""
"The bars grow out of the ring itself, so a “length at silence” of 0\n"
"makes them appear out of literally nothing."
msgstr ""
"条形从圆环本身长出，因此“静音时长度”设为 0 时，\n"
"它们会真正地凭空出现。"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:300
msgid "Relay port:"
msgstr "中继端口："

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:307
msgid "Source:"
msgstr "来源："

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:308
msgid ""
"the spectrum is computed by cava in the plainspectrum-relay service;\n"
"the frequencies and the device are set in ~/.config/plainspectrum/relay.env"
msgstr ""
"频谱由 plainspectrum-relay 服务中的 cava 计算；\n"
"频率和设备在 ~/.config/plainspectrum/relay.env 中设置"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:34
msgctxt "the player drawn inside the visualizer"
msgid "In the ring:"
msgstr "环内："

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:35
msgid "show the player in the centre of the ring"
msgstr "在环的中心显示播放器"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:39
msgid ""
"The track, the position bar and the controls of the player widget,\n"
"drawn over the free disc inside the bars. On a line they go along\n"
"the edge the bars reach last. The ring keeps its size."
msgstr ""
"播放器部件的曲目、进度条和控制按钮，\n"
"绘制在柱条内侧的空白圆盘上。线形布局时沿柱条最后触及的\n"
"边缘排列。环的大小不变。"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:44
msgctxt "settings section"
msgid "Text"
msgstr "文字"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:48
msgid "Font:"
msgstr "字体："

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:55
msgctxt "font size"
msgid "Size:"
msgstr "字号："

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:63
msgid "Width, characters:"
msgstr "宽度 (字符)："

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:70
msgid ""
"The player is this many characters wide and five lines tall;\n"
"a longer title is cut with an ellipsis."
msgstr ""
"播放器宽度为此字符数，高五行；\n"
"过长的标题以省略号截断。"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:75
msgctxt "settings section"
msgid "Palette"
msgstr "调色板"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:78
msgctxt "palette: colour of"
msgid "Main text:"
msgstr "主文字："

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:85
msgctxt "palette: colour of"
msgid "Title:"
msgstr "标题："

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:92
msgctxt "palette: colour of"
msgid "Secondary:"
msgstr "次要文字："

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:98
msgctxt "settings section"
msgid "Player"
msgstr "播放器"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:102
msgid "Player:"
msgstr "播放器："

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:105
msgctxt "player field placeholder"
msgid "whoever is playing"
msgstr "正在播放的那个"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:109
msgid ""
"Empty: whoever is playing. Otherwise a part of the player's name\n"
"or desktop entry — vlc, spotify, strawberry; when no player matches,\n"
"back to whoever is playing."
msgstr ""
"留空：正在播放的那个。否则填播放器名称或\n"
"桌面项的一部分——vlc、spotify、strawberry；没有匹配的播放器时，\n"
"回到正在播放的那个。"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:116
msgid "Album:"
msgstr "专辑："

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:118
msgid "show the album line"
msgstr "显示专辑行"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:123
msgid "Controls:"
msgstr "控制："

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:125
msgid "show the previous, play/pause and next row"
msgstr "显示上一曲、播放/暂停和下一曲一行"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:129
msgid ""
"With no player on the bus the centre of the ring stays empty.\n"
"The controls take the mouse even while the rest passes clicks through."
msgstr ""
"总线上没有播放器时，环的中心保持空白。\n"
"即使其余部分让点击穿透，控制按钮仍会接收鼠标。"

